# Security response headers for the Saltenna site.
#
# Cloudflare Pages honors this _headers file natively — Astro copies
# public/_headers -> dist/ at build, and Pages applies it to every page and
# asset. No extra configuration. After a deploy, sanity-check with:
#   curl -sI https://<host>/ | grep -iE 'content-security|x-content-type|referrer|permissions|strict-transport|x-frame'
#
# --- Content Security Policy ------------------------------------------------
# The CSP is shipped REPORT-ONLY on purpose: it BLOCKS NOTHING yet and only
# logs violations to the browser console. This site has two things a strict
# policy would otherwise break, so it must be verified live before enforcing:
#   1. The /graphics/*.html 3D product viewers use inline <script> blocks.
#   2. The optional LinkedIn newsroom widget (main.js injects a script from
#      widgets.sociablekit.com only when #linkedin-feed has a data-embed-id),
#      which then loads its own scripts/images from SociableKIT + LinkedIn.
#
# TO ENFORCE (Pierce, after deploy): load every page — including each 3D viewer
# and, if the LinkedIn feed is connected, the newsroom — with DevTools open,
# confirm there are no CSP violations, then rename the header below from
# `Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only` to `Content-Security-Policy`.
#
# Allowances are tuned to the site's real dependencies:
#   script-src 'unsafe-inline'  -> inline 3D-viewer scripts + SociableKIT
#   widgets.sociablekit.com     -> LinkedIn newsroom widget
#   media-src media.saltenna.com -> hero/use-case videos from Cloudflare R2
#                                   (PUBLIC_VIDEO_BASE) — change if that host does
#   img-src https:              -> LinkedIn post thumbnails via the widget
#   connect-src *.sociablekit.com + 'self' -> widget backend + posts.json fallback
#   *.cloudflareinsights.com    -> Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon (script + report)

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), payment=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: https:; media-src 'self' https://media.saltenna.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://widgets.sociablekit.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; connect-src 'self' https://widgets.sociablekit.com https://*.sociablekit.com https://cloudflareinsights.com
